        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 2146, Round Dummy Pocket Door Hardware</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Dummy Round Pocket Door Set comes packaged for one door with two flush pulls and an edge pull to help retrieve the door from the pocket. A Dummy Pocket Door Flush Pull Set like this one does not latch or lock. It is most often used on the inactive side of a pair of sliding doors. This Round Dummy Pocket Door Hardware is available in a wide array of finish colors. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Pocket Door Dummy Function:</b> This set neither locks nor latches. It features two flush pulls and an edge pull to help retrieve the door from the pocket.\r\n</p> \r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/passage-round-tubular-pocket-door-set-emtek-2144\"><b>Passage Set</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/privacy-round-tubular-pocket-door-set-emtek-2145\"><b>Privacy Set</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Dummy Round Sliding Door Trim:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Face Plate Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Plate Projection: 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Edge Pull Height: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Edge Pull Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Edge Pull Projection: 3/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" - 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Non-handed</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-2146-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262401\"><b>Emtek 2146 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Set:</b> two (2) flush pulls, an edge pull, and all mounting hardware. <b>For One (1) Door.</b>\r\n</p>",
